        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin KOD-RAR, Arched Kodiak Handleset with Matching Rustic Arched Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic styling of the Kodiak Entrance Set makes it a great choice for traditional homes. This entrance set has a rustic feel that is growing in popularity in the world of home decorating. The covered deadbolt grants it a little something extra--the perfect finishing touch. The Kodiak Handleset is available in either dark bronze or white bronze finishes. Choose from single cylinder, double cylinder, or dummy functions. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, it has a 25 year finish warranty and a lifetime manufacture's warranty. A grade 2 lock, it will fit most predrilled 2-1/8 inch bore hole doors. The adjustable latch will fit 2-3/8 inch backsets or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It will fit 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses all the way up to 2-1/2 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Kodiak Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kodiak Covered Deadbolt Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 10-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Length: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Kodiak Entrance Set with Rustic Arched Rose, Baldwin KOD-RAR",
                "description": "Baldwin KOD-RAR, Kodiak Entrance Set with Rustic Arched Rose - The classic styling of the Kodiak Entrance Set makes it a great choice for traditional homes. This entrance set has a rustic feel that is growing in popularity in the world of home decorating. The covered deadbolt grants it a little something extra--the perfect finishing touch. The Kodiak Handleset is available in either dark bronze or white bronze finishes. Choose from single cylinder, double cylinder, or dummy functions. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, it has a 25 year finish warranty and a lifetime manufacture's warranty. A grade 2 lock, it will fit most predrilled 2-1/8 inch bore hole doors. The adjustable latch will fit 2-3/8 inch backsets or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It will fit 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses all the way up to 2-1/2 inches.",
                "keywords": "covered deadbolt handlesets, traditional entry sets, classic entry sets, traditional front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, Baldwin Reserve Kodiak Handlesets, Kodiak Entrance Set with Rustic Arched Roses, Baldwin KOD-RAR, Arched Kodiak handleset with Matching Rustic Arched Roses, BAL-KOD-RAR, Kodiak Covered Deadbolt Handlesets,"
